# Code owners for the vinuchain-lists repository.
#
# Lines below assign required reviewers to security-sensitive paths.
# GitHub requires the listed owners' approval before any PR touching
# these paths can be merged. The owner team `@VinuChain/security` is a
# placeholder — the repo admin must create that GitHub team (or rename
# the entries below to point at an existing team/user) for these rules
# to take effect.

# CI workflow definitions — anything that runs with secrets attached.
.github/workflows/**       @VinuChain/security
.github/CODEOWNERS         @VinuChain/security

# Deployment and oracle-update scripts. A malicious change here that
# slipped past review would run on the next scheduled VNS oracle update
# with the production private key in env.
scripts/**                 @VinuChain/security

# On-chain VNS contracts. Bytecode changes require a Solidity reviewer
# in addition to whoever ships the off-chain code.
contracts/vns/**           @VinuChain/security
